@@FILE film/BRIEF_TEMPLATE.md
# RANA AI — master brief (paste into Deepy Prime)

Copy everything below the line, fill the [brackets], paste it into Deepy as ONE message.

---

You are the director, writer, cinematographer and editor of a RANA AI advertisement. Make the whole film end to end without asking me questions unless a required file is missing.

**Brand:** RANA AI (ranaai.in) — AI voice employees that make and answer business calls in Indian languages, follow up leads and summarise calls.
**Campaign:** [e.g. "One week of manual outbound calling vs a faster AI workflow with RANA AI"]
**Audience:** [e.g. business owners and sales heads in Hyderabad — real estate, education, clinics]
**Language:** [Telugu with natural English business words] · **Length:** [30–40 seconds] · **Format:** 9:16 vertical, 1080×1920 if the model allows, otherwise the highest it supports.

**Story (adapt, keep it real and human):**
1. Hook (0–4s): [exhausted salesperson, ringing phones, sticky notes] — line: "[opening line]"
2. Problem (4–12s): [manual dialling, writing notes, missed follow-ups]
3. Turn (12–18s): RANA AI takes over the repetitive calls — use my real screenshots in `/kaggle/working/rana/assets/` (interface, dashboard). Do not invent screens.
4. Demo (18–26s): play my real call recording `/kaggle/working/rana/assets/demo_call.wav` (if present) over the shot; never pretend a generated voice is a real customer call.
5. Results (26–32s): dashboard with Hot / Warm / Cold leads from my screenshot, customer names blurred.
6. Reveal (32–40s): salesperson now on one important call, calm. Clean ending (the RANA end card is added afterwards — leave the last 1 s clean).

**Cast (keep identical in every shot):** [Character A: Telugu man, ~30, short black hair, light-blue shirt, office ID lanyard] · [Character B: …]. First create one character sheet per person, then use it as the reference for every shot.

**Look:** photorealistic, real Hyderabad office, natural window light + practical lights, shallow depth of field, 35–50 mm lens feel, slow dolly / handheld moments, no sci-fi effects, no floating holograms, no text inside generated shots.

**Sound:** natural Telugu voice for dialogue and narration (OmniVoice, warm and conversational, real pauses); office ambience, phone rings, notification pings at the right moments; soft modern background music under the voice, lower whenever someone speaks.

**Claims rules:** only say things RANA really does. If you mention speed, say "up to 100 call attempts in about 5 minutes (Scale plan)" — attempts, not conversations. No guaranteed sales or revenue. The AI must not claim to be human.

**Deliver:** one final MP4 with all shots joined in order, voice and music mixed, plus an `.srt` file of every spoken line with timings, saved next to the video. Check the film for black frames, cuts inside shots, silent gaps and spelling before you finish.

**Call to action line (spoken at the end):** "[మీ business కోసం Rana AI ఎలా పనిచేస్తుందో చూడాలనుకుంటున్నారా? DM చేయండి — RANA.]"
